WEBVTT

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:13.660
The drumming entices people into the village.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:22.750
Everywhere one cares to look, the landscape is awash with ruins and monsters.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:30.210
A trace of this horror embeds itself in our traditions,

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:39.010
as the wind that Heaven exhales fails to reach tomorrow.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter Eight

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
The Screeching Ivy

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.880
Hey.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.000
Hey, you there.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:51.810
Could you spare a dime...

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:55.230
for a wretched soul?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.280
It wasn't a war or an accident that made me like this.

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:03.610
I was born this way.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:08.450
It's not as if I want to be like this.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:11.830
Sadly, having been born with this body...

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:18.170
means that begging has become
the only way I can make a living.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:26.640
Wait up. If you show me some charity, I'll tell you something worthwhile in return.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:34.190
So I caught your attention after all.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.730
Money first.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.250
This sure is a small fortune!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.000
Not at all.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.630
You're being targeted.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.210
Targeted?

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:03.130
Maybe it'd be more accurate to say that someone's after you.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.470
But that's not exactly right either...

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.680
There must be a better way of phrasing it...

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.310
What?

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:12.350
Tailing...

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.480
That's it! Someone's tailing you.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.990
What fiend is tailing me?

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.700
Not just one, it's a pair.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.990
You've got two guys tailing you.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:34.000
One of them is just like me.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.500
Like you?

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:39.170
Someone's screwed around with his body.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.090
He has this thick dome on his back.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.590
Some sort of shell...

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.630
A carapace that shields the body?

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.390
That's right.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.510
You'd best watch out if you fight him.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.470
It's not just his shell...

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:58.230
Don't allow his words to confuse you.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.360
And the other?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.820
A woman...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:06.740
She's a looker, but don't take her lightly or she might seduce and capture you.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:13.660
Ever been chased by a woman before?

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:14.660
No.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:18.170
You look like a ladies' man though.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:24.960
So, was my advice worth it?

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.970
Indeed it was.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:32.180
If that's the case, could you help me out with something else?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.680
With what?

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:44.980
Sorry to ask you this, but could you throw this plastic bag away for me? Anywhere's fine.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.320
What is this?

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.830
This is excrement, is it not?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.200
You request that I dispose of your feces for you?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:03.090
It's processed in such a way that it shouldn't smell at all, but...

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:05.880
you've got a good nose on you.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.470
Even with a body like this,

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:13.390
when I eat something, some of it will still turn into waste.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:20.310
It all gets automatically packed into this plastic bag.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:26.690
Sadly, I've spent pretty much all my money on food and these plastic bags.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:32.910
Lately, it's not been easy getting ahold of these bags.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:38.910
Without these bags, the lower half of my body would fill up with shit.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:43.920
If that happens, the stench will make people avoid me when I'm begging.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.920
True enough.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:50.380
I suppose I could lower myself into the river and wash it all away,

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.550
but I'm afraid of rivers.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:58.390
It's hard getting in and even more difficult getting out.

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:04.940
The river's full of stones and I'm scared that they may cause me to lose my balance.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:08.440
But you probably don't understand how it feels.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.320
No matter. Your information may be of considerable use to me.

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:13.910
I will dispose of it for you.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.330
There's three days' worth in there.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.500
Thanks a lot. You've been a great help.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:51.500
Anything else I can help you with to express my gratitude?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:55.550
You look like you're searching for something.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:59.510
I'll tell you anything you want to know.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.970
If that is so, tell me this:

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.350
where is the Butcher's shop?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.520
The Butcher's?

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.520
The one with an emblem of a snake's head.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.020
A snake's head...

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:17.530
Are you sure you want me to tell you where that is?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.030
What do you mean by that?

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:24.870
If you go there, there's no coming back.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:28.330
You may even die.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:31.040
You're gonna regret...

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.960
getting mixed up in a fight there.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.800
You'll lose those you care for.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:45.220
You'll experience unspeakable pain.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:50.230
Much blood will flow!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.740
Hey, Kuro!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.000
Hey, Kuro, where are you?!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.170
You need not answer him.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.210
Kuro, what are you doing?

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.460
Feces...

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.470
Feces?! What do you mean by feces?!

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:19.880
Get ahold of yourself!

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.840
No need to answer.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:29.680
You disposed of three days' worth of shit for me.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.190
I appreciate it.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:39.610
"Shit in both hands, and shit is heard."

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.360
"Does a dog shit or not?"

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:47.830
"Don't use objects to teach about shit."

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.910
"I don't use shit to explain the ultimate."

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:56.210
"What is the meaning of the shit coming from the West?"

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.720
Let's go. Saniwa's in trouble.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.680
Looks like you're too late, Kuro.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.390
"Where have you taken Lady Kuromitsu?!"

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:59.520
You... did this to Saniwa...?

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:01.280
I did.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:06.280
Don't you want to know how she ended up like this?

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:11.290
If you really want to know, I will re-enact everything for you!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:15.790
Show me.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.050
Very well!

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:23.920
Begin!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:30.430
"Where... Where have you taken Lady Kuromitsu?!"

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.430
"What was that, Saniwa?"

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:38.940
"Lady Kuromitsu is revered by the residents of Kagura.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:45.950
We all view her in the same light: as the guardian angel of the village.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.030
Because of her,

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:54.370
I once again have the courage to sacrifice my own life to protect her.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.660
That is how unflinching I am in my duty!

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.000
And yet, you lowlifes..."

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.460
"Hell if I know!"

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.880
After saying that, I unleashed my tentacles of ivy.

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.090
Then, suddenly...

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.890
A supernatural vortex of flower petals whirled upwards!

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.560
Then, Saniwa said:

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:17.690
"I am one with the flora and fauna of Kagura forest.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.690
Before your last breath escapes your lungs,

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:24.610
tell me the location of Lady Kuromitsu!"

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:31.370
I grabbed my throat as if I was suffocating, but it was all an act!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:35.240
Because my ivy has already...

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.420
How unpleasant.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:52.930
"'In the beginning... concepts such as beauty...

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.980
and ugliness... never existed in this world.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:00.310
Even if they exist now...

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.900
they are concepts that only exist in the hearts of humankind.'

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:07.940
Lady Kuromitsu once told me that.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:14.910
She told me that I was a sacred being."

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.930
And so, that's what happened.

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:42.440
How rude!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.610
After I was kind enough to tell you what took place!

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:49.360
You're such an ungrateful jerk.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.080
Everything is an illusion,

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.160
as if you're lost in the labyrinth of Hell's roads.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:49.670
You plummet into the infinite darkness.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:53.170
Is this a blessing or a curse?

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:56.430
Sometimes you play with bullets! Sometimes with cards!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.420
What name do you go by?

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:30.090
K-Kagetsu.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:53.980
H-How dare you!

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:39.950
Lady Kuromitsu...

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.830
Saniwa...

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:47.250
I shall never forget...

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:50.670
the residents of Kagura.

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:56.760
As you have shown today, what you have achieved in my name has allowed me to move as freely as I do now.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:02.430
You have truly endeavored greatly for me.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:06.770
Your soul shall first return to the cycle...

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:09.560
And then, I shall repay your kindness.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.310
I am not worthy of such words.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.360
Kuromitsu...

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:28.750
We meet once again, my beloved Kuro.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:34.130
For you to travel to the distant Kagura...

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.510
It buoys my elated heart.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.470
However,

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:44.550
now is not the time for our tender reunion.

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:46.970
What do you mean?

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:52.980
All shall be revealed at the Red Castle.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:26.800
Violating three thousand worlds,

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:30.730
the black eagle commits murder.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:36.940
I wanted to stay with you till the break of dawn.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.570
Kuromitsu is...?

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:44.200
Yeah.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.120
All will become apparent if I travel there.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.910
Therefore, allow me to depart for the Red Castle.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.370
That's the enemy's base...

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.250
You think we can just march in by ourselves?

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.250
Kuro...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.670
If you...

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.930
If you truly aim to break the curse of time and fate,

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:12.730
you'll surely seek out the light...

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:39.790
There is only one way into the Red Castle.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.710
Over this drawbridge.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.840
Once a day,

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:48.010
the bridge is lowered to let the patrol tanks back in.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:52.970
That'll be our only chance to get inside.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:57.480
It's gonna be like attacking an iron wall with a needle.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:19:59.480
Even so...

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.690
We have to go.

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.030
To Kanto...

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.070
To the Red Castle!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:28.170
Fire
Whirlwind
